cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Se usi Acchiappaspettri in un lavoro scientifico, citalo così. If you use Acchiappaspettri in scientific work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Acchiappaspettri"
abstract: >-
  Acchiappaspettri turns spectra and chromatograms saved as files (FTIR, Raman,
  UV-Vis, fluorescence, HPLC, XRF, LIBS, TGA, DSC, NMR, EPR) into clean plots and
  scientific analysis, as a web page and as a desktop application. Data stay on
  the user's computer.
authors:
